{"name":"Topsail","hex":"#dae2e0","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Topsail","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A neighbourhood of Conception Bay South, Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Topsail"}],"entries":[{"title":"Topsail","blocks":[{"text":"A topsail (\"tops'l\") is a sail set above another sail. On square-rigged vessels further sails may be set above topsails. Except when pole masts are used, a topsail takes its name from the mast on which it is set: the top-mast."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d4/Sails_19th_century_ship.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topsail","wikidata":"Q1452598"},{"title":"Topsail (electoral district)","blocks":[{"text":"Topsail is a defunct provincial electoral district for the House of Assembly of Newfoundland and Labrador, Canada. In 2011, there were 11,080 eligible voters living in the district. The district was abolished in 2015 and was mostly replaced by Topsail-Paradise. Parts of the riding were also redistributed into Mount Scio, Mount Pearl North, and Conception Bay South."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Topsail.png/330px-Topsail.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Topsail_(electoral_district)","wikidata":"Q7825144"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/USS_Constitution_1997.jpg/500px-USS_Constitution_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/USS_Constitution_1997.jpg/1280px-USS_Constitution_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/84/USS_Constitution_1997.jpg/500px-USS_Constitution_1997.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"USS Constitution sailing under (bow to stern) jibs, topsails, and spanker.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AUSS_Constitution_1997.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/La_Recouvrance.JPG/500px-La_Recouvrance.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/La_Recouvrance.JPG/1280px-La_Recouvrance.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/La_Recouvrance.JPG/500px-La_Recouvrance.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"La Recouvrance with both a gaff topsail (set on the mainmast) and a square topsail on the foremast (above which is a topgallant); the partly obscured sail between the topmasts is a topmast staysail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALa_Recouvrance.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg/1280px-Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg/500px-Luggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Luggers with lug topsails set","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALuggers_at_Looe_Bay_-_panoramio.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Thames_Barges-Canthusus.jpg/330px-Thames_Barges-Canthusus.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm